# Org logos

Company marks live in `org-logos/<id>/` (`brand.json` + `logo.png` or `.svg`). `brands/<id>/` is a fallback.

- Never commit customer logos or any PNG/SVG wordmark.
- When asked to use a company logo, read `org-logos/<id>/` (prompt: `Use the Acme logo from org-logos/acme.` or `Use logo <id> located in the project org-logos section.`).
- Activate with `BRAND=<id>` in `.env.local`. Missing pack → Scoping. Do not throw.
